<view class="page">
<text class="eyebrow">ZZULITE · DEMO</text><view class="title">公开演示</view>
<view class="demo-notice"><view class="heading">以下全部为虚构示例</view><view>供所有用户了解功能，不代表任何真实学生、余额或宿舍电量。无需账号，不连接学校服务，不读取或修改你的真实缓存。</view></view>
<view class="tabs"><button wx:for="{{sections}}" wx:key="*this" class="tab {{section === index ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseSection">{{item}}</button></view>
<block wx:if="{{section === 0}}"><view class="card"><view class="row"><button class="week-button" bindtap="previous" disabled="{{week <= 1}}">上一周</button><text class="heading">示例第 {{week}} 周</text><button class="week-button" bindtap="next" disabled="{{week >= 20}}">下一周</button></view><view class="small">周次切换交互演示；以下使用固定示例课程。</view></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{courses}}" wx:key="id"><text class="badge">{{item.day}} · 示例</text><view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view><view class="course-time">{{item.time}}</view><view class="small">{{item.place}}</view></view></block>
<block wx:elif="{{section === 1}}"><view class="card"><picker range="{{semesters}}" value="{{semester}}" bindchange="semester"><view class="link">{{semesters[semester]}} · 切换学期 ›</view></picker><input class="field" placeholder="搜索示例课程" value="{{search}}" bindinput="search"/></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{grades}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><text class="heading">{{item.name}}</text><text class="score">{{item.score}}</text></view><view class="small">{{item.credits}} 学分 · {{item.note}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!grades.length}}" class="empty">没有匹配的示例成绩</view></block>
<block wx:elif="{{section === 2}}"><view class="balance-card"><view>示例校园卡 · 虚构余额</view><view class="balance">¥ 23.50</view><view>余额仅用于展示，无付款或充值能力</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="refresh">刷新演示</button><view class="small">{{refreshed ? '已重新展示固定示例，未发起网络查询。' : '点击体验刷新交互，示例金额不会发生实际变化。'}}</view><view class="card small">真实余额需登录学校账号查询。本演示不创建订单，也不向任何账户付款。</view></block>
<block wx:elif="{{section === 3}}"><view class="card"><picker range="{{meterNames}}" value="{{meterIndex}}" bindchange="chooseMeter"><view class="link">{{meter.name}}电表 · 切换 ›</view></picker><view class="small">{{meter.room}} · 虚构编号</view><view class="energy">{{meter.kwh}} <text class="small">度（示例）</text></view><view class="small">以下是虚构的剩余电量记录，不是实时功率。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">示例记录</view><view class="reading row" wx:for="{{meter.readings}}" wx:key="time"><text class="small">{{item.time}}</text><text>{{item.value}} 度</text></view></view></block>
<block wx:else><view class="card"><view class="heading">示例教学楼 · A101</view><view class="small">示例日期、虚构占用情况，不代表教室实际开放状态。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="toggleRoom">{{occupied ? '切换为无记录示例' : '切换为占用示例'}}</button><view class="heading">{{occupied ? '示例占用：08:00–09:40' : '示例：未查询到占用记录'}}</view></view></block>
<view class="card"><view class="heading">准备使用自己的数据？</view><view class="small">真实课表、成绩、校园卡与电量查询需要学校账号及有效会话，可能需要学校短信验证。演示不改变真实登录状态。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login">前往学校账号登录</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="exit">退出演示，返回首页</button></view>
</view>
